    <briefdescription>
<para>Builds strategy-specific, self-aware critique and revision prompts. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The &quot;dynamic&quot; nature comes from injecting the <computeroutput><ref refid="structthemis_1_1prompt__engineering_1_1_self_aware_context" kindref="compound">SelfAwareContext</ref></computeroutput> extracted from the model&apos;s own response back into the next critique prompt, creating a feedback loop:</para>
<para>response → <ref refid="structthemis_1_1prompt__engineering_1_1_self_aware_context_1a251a3f892425e56c5770d6079a46b4e8" kindref="member">SelfAwareContext::fromResponse()</ref> → context-adaptive critique</para>
<para>When <computeroutput>ctx</computeroutput> indicates low confidence, the critique template emphasises factual verification. When <computeroutput>ctx</computeroutput> indicates high confidence, the template checks for overconfidence that may mask inaccuracies. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
